DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17820::$$$message_0134_0000_0000$$$::"I'll look around here."[lr]::
17821::$$$message_0134_0000_0001$$$::I stop by the home appliances area.[lr]::
17822::$$$message_0134_0000_0002$$$::It makes me want to see the newest home appliances on a bit of a whim.::
17823::$$$message_0134_0001_0000$$$::"Hmm... Things are getting thinner and bigger."[lr]::
17824::$$$message_0134_0001_0001$$$::Among them, there's an exceptionally big TV that stands out more than the others.[lr]::
17825::$$$message_0134_0001_0002$$$::This...doesn't quite go with our place.[lr]::
17826::$$$message_0134_0001_0003$$$::Even if we have a lot of people, it's not like they like watching TV.::
17827::$$$message_0134_0002_0000$$$::"Well whether it matches or not, it's this expensive...? I can't afford this."[lr]::
17828::$$$message_0134_0002_0001$$$::TVs have a high voltage, so it would be dangerous to pick one up and fix it.[lr]::
17829::$$$message_0134_0002_0002$$$::When it comes to this, buying it brand new is the only choice...::
17830::$$$message_0134_0003_0000$$$::"Oh, speaking of brand new, this is also an issue."[lr]::
17831::$$$message_0134_0003_0001$$$::Our recording device is also a generation old.[lr]::
17832::$$$message_0134_0003_0002$$$::We haven't been driven by necessity yet, but I want to take a leap in the dark and get a DVD recorder...::
17833::$$$message_0134_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, Emiya. What are you doing here?"[lr]::
17834::$$$message_0134_0004_0001$$$::"...Hey, Tohsaka. I could ask you the same thing."[lr]::
17835::$$$message_0134_0004_0002$$$::It's rare to run into each other in the electronics section.[lr]::
17836::$$$message_0134_0004_0003$$$::...It would be more believable if it was in the middle of the antique furniture section.::
17837::$$$message_0134_0005_0000$$$::"Wow. You're also thinking of buying a replacement?"[lr]::
17838::$$$message_0134_0005_0001$$$::"Huh? What are you saying? I just happened to see you, so I called out to you."[lr]::
17839::$$$message_0134_0005_0002$$$::"Oh really? Thought so."[lr]::
17840::$$$message_0134_0005_0003$$$::...I feel like the vacuum cleaner is the most advanced appliance that Tohsaka would be able to use.[lr]::
17841::$$$message_0134_0005_0004$$$::I don't think Tohsaka can use something that has more than ten buttons.::
17842::$$$message_0134_0006_0000$$$::"...Emiya, is there any chance that you're thinking about something very rude?"[lr]::
17843::$$$message_0134_0006_0001$$$::"It might be slightly rude. Well, you know how you're[line len=2]"[lr]::
17844::$$$message_0134_0006_0002$$$::"You're trying to say that I'm not good with machines, right?"::
17845::$$$message_0134_0007_0000$$$::"Well, more like you try to stay away from them, right?[lr]::
17846::$$$message_0134_0007_0001$$$::With the way that you stay away from them, it's like you're borderline allergic, though. When it comes to machines, Sakura..."[lr]::
17847::$$$message_0134_0007_0002$$$::Oh... She's mad.[lr]::
17848::$$$message_0134_0007_0003$$$::Humans either get happy or mad when they're told the truth.::
17849::$$$message_0134_0008_0000$$$::"Heheheh... So that's how you see me, Shirou."[lr]::
17850::$$$message_0134_0008_0001$$$::"Isn't it okay? You brush off most things, right? What's wrong with having at least one shortcoming?"[lr]::
17851::$$$message_0134_0008_0002$$$::...Well, there's one other crucial shortcoming, but I'll not mention it.::
17852::$$$message_0134_0009_0000$$$::"...I'll thank you.[lr]::
17853::$$$message_0134_0009_0001$$$::But, having no weaknesses is my family's ideal... [cacheimage storage=凛私服07b腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服07b腕a(中) textoff=0]I can't be saying that I'm not good with them forever."[lr]::
17854::$$$message_0134_0009_0002$$$::"I see. So, you came here trying to learn a bit."::
17855::$$$message_0134_0010_0000$$$::"Just...kidding. That's for later.[lr]::
17856::$$$message_0134_0010_0001$$$::I need to learn about this kind of stuff from Ayako and get used to the newest devices."[lr]::
17857::$$$message_0134_0010_0002$$$::"Ah, I would think Ayako is more knowledgeable when it comes to information about electronics than me."::
17858::$$$message_0134_0011_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri is the former kyudo club captain and she seems like a martial artist, but she actually keeps up to date on arcades and stuff.[lr]::
17859::$$$message_0134_0011_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06e(中) textoff=0]It's frustrating that she doesn't talk to me about it, since I don't do any of that though.[lr]::
17860::$$$message_0134_0011_0002$$$::According to the kyudo club members, she's up all night playing games where you repeat simple tasks.::
17861::$$$message_0134_0012_0000$$$::"So. You came to do your research before you learn from Mitsuzuri?"[lr]::
17862::$$$message_0134_0012_0001$$$::"W-Well, yeah. I don't want people to think that I'm an old-fashioned, antique woman.[lr]::
17863::$$$message_0134_0012_0002$$$::Umm... I'm not from the nineteenth century, so I know enough. That area has LCD screens, right?"::
17864::$$$message_0134_0013_0000$$$::What Tohsaka is pointing at is the big LCD screen I was just looking at.[lr]::
17865::$$$message_0134_0013_0001$$$::I'm impressed. Very well, she must've been able to tell since the exterior is thin.[lr]::
17866::$$$message_0134_0013_0002$$$::...Does she know the difference between plasma and LCD? I refrain from asking her that, since she would probably go quiet.::
17867::$$$message_0134_0014_0000$$$::"You were just looking at that, but do you want it?"[lr]::
17868::$$$message_0134_0014_0001$$$::"I was thinking it would be nice, but I can't afford it. Plus, it won't look good at my house."[lr]::
17869::$$$message_0134_0014_0002$$$::"My house too...[cacheimage storage=凛私服09f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=凛私服09f(中) time=300 textoff=0]wait, it costs that much?[lr]::
17870::$$$message_0134_0014_0003$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服14c(中) time=300 textoff=0]I could buy a 20-carat ruby with that!"[lr]::
17871::$$$message_0134_0014_0004$$$::Tohsaka is pale from looking at the price tag.[lr]::
17872::$$$message_0134_0014_0005$$$::Using jewels as the comparison criteria[line len=3]how luxurious. I would compare it to how many months' worth of food it could buy.::
17873::$$$message_0134_0015_0000$$$::"Yeah, this is an item that's out of our league."[lr]::
17874::$$$message_0134_0015_0001$$$::"There isn't anyone unsatisfied with our screen being small at our place."[lr]::
17875::$$$message_0134_0015_0002$$$::"And, that area has the video recorders."[lr]::
17876::$$$message_0134_0015_0003$$$::In the direction that Tohsaka pointed at this time is...::
17877::$$$message_0134_0016_0000$$$::"Too bad, you're wrong."[lr]::
17878::$$$message_0134_0016_0001$$$::"No way, it looks just like those video things."[lr]::
17879::$$$message_0134_0016_0002$$$::"No, over there, right?[lr]::
17880::$$$message_0134_0016_0003$$$::Those are DVD players for playing back."[lr]::
17881::$$$message_0134_0016_0004$$$::When we go together to the area with the recording equipment lined up on the shelf... Yeah, it can't be helped if Tohsaka doesn't know.::
17882::$$$message_0134_0017_0000$$$::"...What do you mean?"[lr]::
17883::$$$message_0134_0017_0001$$$::"This one is for playing back, this one is HDD+DVD-RW, this one is HDD+DVD-RAM, this one is an HDD only recorder, this one is for satellite TV..."::
17884::$$$message_0134_0018_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17885::$$$message_0134_0018_0001$$$::As I'm explaining, I feel like I've become Tohsaka's enemy.[lr]::
17886::$$$message_0134_0018_0002$$$::I feel like there's a technological and generational gap between me and Tohsaka...and that she is gradually departing from the electronics section and this world.::
17887::$$$message_0134_0019_0000$$$::"Um, is that some spell?"[lr]::
17888::$$$message_0134_0019_0001$$$::"I also thought it was like a spell. Apparently Blu-ray and HD-DVD will be coming soon."[lr]::
17889::$$$message_0134_0019_0002$$$::"Blue ray? [cacheimage storage=凛私服03d2(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03d2(中) textoff=0]So where are the video things..."[lr]::
17890::$$$message_0134_0019_0003$$$::"Over there. They still have some demand."[lr]::
17891::$$$message_0134_0019_0004$$$::I guess it's too harsh to tell her to be able to distinguish them just by looking.[lr]::
17892::$$$message_0134_0019_0005$$$::This area also multiplied in the blink of an eye... The golden age of VHS during my childhood is nostalgic.::
17893::$$$message_0134_0020_0000$$$::"...This can also record TV, right?"[lr]::
17894::$$$message_0134_0020_0001$$$::"It's not always just that, but pretty much.[lr]::
17895::$$$message_0134_0020_0002$$$::I bet you still believe that your soul will get taken if someone takes a picture of you with a camera[line len=3]"[lr]::
17896::$$$message_0134_0020_0003$$$::"They can."::
17897::$$$message_0134_0021_0000$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
17898::$$$message_0134_0021_0001$$$::"If you make the proper modifications to the lens and printing paper, they will become the right materials. [cacheimage storage=凛私服05a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服05a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Well, it'd be more accurate to say your soul would be suspended rather than taken."::
17899::$$$message_0134_0022_0000$$$::"Even if it's a digicam?"[lr]::
17900::$$$message_0134_0022_0001$$$::...Tohsaka murmurs, "A what-cam?"[lr]::
17901::$$$message_0134_0022_0002$$$::She doesn't know what "digicam" is short for, so my joke falls flat.::
17902::$$$message_0134_0023_0000$$$::"...Um, what is it again? [cacheimage storage=凛私服06e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06e(中) textoff=0]Dee-vee-dee?"[lr]::
17903::$$$message_0134_0023_0001$$$::"DVD stands for Digital Versatile Disk."[lr]::
17904::$$$message_0134_0023_0002$$$::"...You said RAM and RW, but what's the difference?"[lr]::
17905::$$$message_0134_0023_0003$$$::[font italic=true]...Uhhh.[font italic=false][lr]::
17906::$$$message_0134_0023_0004$$$::Even though I explained like I know what I'm talking about... I can't explicitly explain what the difference is.[lr]::
17907::$$$message_0134_0023_0005$$$::I know there are people with religion-like passion when it comes to these things, but I have no idea as a non-user.::
17908::$$$message_0134_0024_0000$$$::"...Sorry, I don't really know."[lr]::
17909::$$$message_0134_0024_0001$$$::"See, look at you.[lr]::
17910::$$$message_0134_0024_0002$$$::If you're like that, then how am I supposed to know anything about them? [cacheimage storage=凛私服06f(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服06f(中) time=300 textoff=0]From my point of view, these modern things are much more like magecraft."[lr]::
17911::$$$message_0134_0024_0003$$$::So you can't tell the difference between magecraft and technology that has advanced this much?::
17912::$$$message_0134_0025_0000$$$::"...Hey, Tohsaka. [cacheimage storage=凛私服06e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06e(中) textoff=0]It's not good to be pessimistic. Humans can live without DVDs."[lr]::
17913::$$$message_0134_0025_0001$$$::"The same can be said about phones or TVs where we're [font italic=true]somehow[font italic=false] able to get by, right? [cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服01e(中) time=300 textoff=0]Geez, both you and I are going to be laughed at by Ayako as ancient humans."[lr]::
17914::$$$message_0134_0025_0002$$$::I can imagine her laughing, calling us old-fashioned.[lr]::
17915::$$$message_0134_0025_0003$$$::...We can't confess to her that it's because we're mages no matter what.::
17916::$$$message_0134_0026_0000$$$::"Are you going to buy one of these too, Shirou?"[lr]::
17917::$$$message_0134_0026_0001$$$::"I'm thinking of getting one before our war between channels gets worse, but...it's not cheap."[lr]::
17918::$$$message_0134_0026_0002$$$::"Your place has become a big family... [cacheimage storage=凛私服05f(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服05f(中) time=300 textoff=0]Oh, that includes me too."[lr]::
17919::$$$message_0134_0026_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01e(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka, who goes back and forth between her own place and my place, is laughing as if she's just realizing this now.::
17920::$$$message_0134_0027_0000$$$::"Hmm, we can accommodate two or three more people, so don't worry about it."[lr]::
17921::$$$message_0134_0027_0001$$$::"...You seem like you'd be a good fit as a housefather of a boarding house or the owner of a bed and breakfast, Emiya."[lr]::
17922::$$$message_0134_0027_0002$$$::Rather than seeming like a good fit, I already am like one.[lr]::
17923::$$$message_0134_0027_0003$$$::Once I eventually become a full-fledged mage... How will my life change from the way it is now?::
17924::$$$message_0134_0028_0000$$$::"I'm starting to think that kind of life isn't bad, either."[lr]::
17925::$$$message_0134_0028_0001$$$::"Well, I'm not going to let you seclude yourself, so don't worry.[lr]::
17926::$$$message_0134_0028_0002$$$::...Now. There isn't anything we can do even if we're here, so let's go somewhere else."[lr]::
17927::$$$message_0134_0028_0003$$$::Tohsaka urges me to keep her company as if it's natural.[lr]::
17928::$$$message_0134_0028_0004$$$::That's fine, but at this rate, I'm worried about how she'll manage later.[lr]::
17929::$$$message_0134_0028_0005$$$::Her study of electronics didn't even last five minutes..._�<�